      "(select X and Y, then click Check)": "(seleccione X e Y, luego haga clic en Verificar)",
      ". The two calls make an alarm more plausible, which raises the posterior probability of burglary. Then add evidence that an earthquake occurred. The burglary probability falls because the earthquake already provides an explanation for the alarm and the calls.": ". The two calls make an alarm more plausible, which raises the posterior probability of burglary. Then add evidence that an earthquake occurred. The burglary probability falls because the earthquake already provides an explanation for the alarm and the calls.",
